---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import scarfSaffron from '../assets/images/scarf-saffron.png';
---
<section class="making" aria-labelledby="making-title">
  <div class="page making__inner">
    <figure class="making__image-wrap">
      <Image
        src={scarfSaffron}
        alt="A scarf with pressed leaves and small yellow flower marks, hanging in afternoon light."
        class="making__image"
        widths={[480, 768, 1024]}
        sizes="(max-width: 880px) 100vw, 45vw"
        loading="lazy"
        format="avif"
      />
    </figure>
    <div class="making__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow making__eyebrow">The making</span>
      <h2 id="making-title" class="making__head">The print is the plant itself.</h2>
      <p class="making__body">
        We forage leaves and petals close to the studio, with a basket and a name
        for every plant. They are pressed into cloth still damp, rolled tight, and
        set with steam over hours. The fabric keeps the print as a kind of memory,
        faint at the edges, deepest where the leaf lay longest.
      </p>
      <p class="making__body">
        No two pieces leave the studio the same. We finish them by hand and send
        them on.
      </p>
      <p class="making__signoff">— Juhi and Rohan</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
